  {
   "id": "2be022fc",
   "kieu": "lat",
   "muc": "V. Bài toán mẫu: la bàn đặt cạnh dây dẫn",
   "neo": "Kim la bàn đặt cạnh dây có dòng điện chỉ theo hướng nào? Góc",
   "hoi": "Kim la bàn đặt cạnh dây có dòng điện chỉ theo hướng nào? Góc lệch tính ra sao?",
   "dap": "<ul><li>Kim chỉ theo <strong>từ trường tổng hợp</strong></li><li>Từ trường của dây vuông góc $B_\\text{đ}$: $\\tan\\alpha = \\dfrac{B_1}{B_\\text{đ}}$</li><li>Cùng phương, cùng chiều: cộng lại, kim không lệch</li></ul>",
   "hinh": "<figure class=\"fig\" data-tl=\"1\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 440 240\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Hai từ trường thành phần vuông góc: 30 microtesla hướng bắc và 40 microtesla hướng đông, tổng hợp 50 microtesla lệch 53 độ\"><defs><marker id=\"f5-r\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#f87171\"/></marker><marker id=\"f5-b\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#38bdf8\"/></marker><marker id=\"f5-o\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#fb923c\"/></marker><marker id=\"f5-g\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#34d399\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"204\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"204\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" opacity=\"1\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"204\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"46\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" opacity=\"1\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"228\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"end\">đông</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"36\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">bắc</text><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"204\" r=\"5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"204\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"132.0\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"2.8\"/><path d=\"M144.2,142.0 L150.0,132.0 L155.8,142.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"204\" x2=\"246.0\" y2=\"204\" stroke=\"#f87171\" stroke-width=\"2.8\"/><path d=\"M236.0,198.2 L246.0,204.0 L236.0,209.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f87171\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"204\" x2=\"246.0\" y2=\"132.0\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2.8\"/><path d=\"M234.6,133.4 L246.0,132.0 L241.5,142.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><text x=\"136\" y=\"138.0\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"end\">B<tspan font-size=\"14\" baseline-shift=\"sub\">đ</tspan> = 30 µT</text><text x=\"198.0\" y=\"228\" fill=\"#f87171\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">B<tspan font-size=\"14\" baseline-shift=\"sub\">1</tspan> = 40 µT</text><text x=\"254.0\" y=\"128.0\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\">B = 50 µT</text><line x1=\"246.0\" y1=\"132.0\" x2=\"246.0\" y2=\"204\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" opacity=\"0.45\"/><line x1=\"246.0\" y1=\"132.0\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"132.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" opacity=\"0.45\"/><path d=\"M150,162 A42,42 0 0,1 183.6,178.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"156\" y=\"152\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\">53°</text></svg></figure>"
